59
00:04:05,109 --> 00:04:08,803
Split missing pieces into two kinds.

60
00:04:08,803 --> 00:04:12,498
Substitutable: a lost meeple, a token, a
die, a bill of play money.

61
00:04:12,498 --> 00:04:16,192
